# Anchored to repo root only — apps/web/public and apps/portal/public are real
# Next.js static asset directories (favicons, logo, marketing video) that the
# web/portal Docker builds need in their build context. A bare "public" pattern
# would have excluded those too, silently shipping images with missing assets.
